<title>What's New in CSPro 8.2?</title>
<context ID_HELP_WHAT_IS_NEW />

This is a detailed list of changes in CSPro 8.2. For a more general overview, see the <i>readme.txt</i> file located in the CSPro installation folder.


<subheader>CSPro Designer</subheader>

<list>
    <li>The <link dictionary_analysis.csdoc>Dictionary Analysis</link> reports have been moved to a single dialog. New reports include information about <link linked_value_sets.csdoc>linked value sets</link> and <link special_values.csdoc>special values</link>.</li>
</list>


<seealso what_is_new_in_cspro.csdoc />
